) VALUES (
    'evolution-of-ski-equipment',
    '{"en": "Evolution of Ski Equipment: From Wood to Carbon Fiber", "de": "Evolution der Skiausrüstung: Vom Holz zur Carbonfaser", "fr": "Évolution de l''équipement de ski : Du bois à la fibre de carbone", "it": "Evoluzione dell''attrezzatura da sci: Dal legno alla fibra di carbonio", "es": "Evolución del equipo de esquí: De la madera a la fibra de carbono", "pt": "Evolução do equipamento de esqui: Da madeira à fibra de carbono", "nl": "Evolutie van ski-uitrusting: Van hout tot koolstofvezel", "ar": "تطور معدات التزلج: من الخشب إلى ألياف الكربون", "ja": "スキー用品の進化：木材からカーボンファイバーへ", "zh": "Huaxue Zhuangbei de Yanbian: Cong Mutou dao Tanxianwei", "ko": "스키 장비의 진화: 나무에서 탄소 섬유로"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "Ski equipment has evolved dramatically from simple wooden planks to high-tech racing machines. Each innovation has allowed athletes to go faster, turn sharper, and push harder.", "de": "Skiausrüstung hat sich dramatisch von einfachen Holzbrettern zu High-Tech-Rennmaschinen entwickelt.", "fr": "L''équipement de ski a évolué de façon spectaculaire, des simples planches de bois aux machines de course high-tech.", "it": "L''attrezzatura da sci si è evoluta drammaticamente da semplici assi di legno a macchine da corsa high-tech.", "es": "El equipo de esquí ha evolucionado dramáticamente desde simples tablas de madera hasta máquinas de carreras de alta tecnología.", "pt": "O equipamento de esqui evoluiu dramaticamente de simples pranchas de madeira para máquinas de corrida de alta tecnologia.", "nl": "Ski-uitrusting is dramatisch geëvolueerd van eenvoudige houten planken tot hightech racemachines.", "ar": "تطورت معدات التزلج بشكل كبير من ألواح خشبية بسيطة إلى آلات سباق عالية التقنية", "ja": "スキー用品は、シンプルな木製の板からハイテクレーシングマシンへと劇的に進化してきました。", "zh": "Huaxue zhuangbei cong jiandan de muban fazhan dao gao keji bisai jixie.", "ko": "스키 장비는 단순한 나무 판자에서 첨단 레이싱 머신으로 극적으로 발전했습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>The technology behind skiing has transformed beyond recognition since the sport''s earliest days. Every piece of modern ski equipment represents centuries of innovation, from the skis themselves to the boots, bindings, and safety gear.</p><h2>Ancient Skis</h2><p>The earliest skis, dating back over 5,000 years, were simple wooden planks—often different lengths, with one long \"gliding\" ski and one shorter \"pushing\" ski. Early bindings were nothing more than leather straps that held the foot loosely in place.</p><p>For thousands of years, ski design changed little. Wood remained the material of choice, with ash and hickory preferred for their combination of strength and flexibility.</p><h2>Metal Edges Revolution</h2><p>In 1928, Austrian inventor Rudolph Lettner introduced metal edges to skis, transforming the sport. Metal edges allowed skiers to grip hard-packed snow and ice, enabling the carved turns that define modern skiing.</p><p>This single innovation opened the door to alpine ski racing, where edge grip is essential for maintaining speed through turns.</p><h2>Laminated Construction</h2><p>The 1930s brought laminated ski construction, sandwiching multiple layers of wood together. This allowed manufacturers to fine-tune flex patterns and create stronger, more responsive skis.</p><p>Howard Head''s introduction of metal skis in 1950 further revolutionized the industry. His aluminum-laminate design was lighter and more durable than traditional wood.</p><h2>The Plastic Age</h2><p>Fiberglass and plastic composites arrived in the 1960s, dramatically changing ski performance and durability. Plastic bases slid faster than wood, and fiberglass allowed for previously impossible construction techniques.</p><p>Foam cores replaced solid wood, reducing weight while maintaining strength. Modern skis combine these materials in sophisticated sandwich constructions.</p><h2>Binding Evolution</h2><p>Early bindings simply held the foot to the ski, with disastrous consequences when falls occurred. The development of release bindings in the 1950s and 1960s saved countless knees and ankles.</p><p>Modern bindings are engineering marvels, precisely calibrated to release under specific forces while holding securely during normal skiing. DIN settings allow adjustments for skier weight, ability, and conditions.</p><h2>Boot Technology</h2><p>Leather ski boots gave way to plastic shells in the 1960s. The stiff plastic provided far better control and power transmission than soft leather could achieve.</p><p>Today''s racing boots are custom-molded to individual feet, with precise flex patterns and adjustment systems that allow millimeter-accurate positioning.</p><h2>Safety Innovations</h2><p>Helmets, once rare, are now nearly universal in competitive skiing. Advanced materials absorb impacts while remaining light and comfortable. Airbag systems protect against avalanches. Body armor protects against crashes at racing speeds.</p><h2>Racing Technology</h2><p>World Cup racing skis are engineering masterpieces. Carbon fiber construction provides exceptional strength-to-weight ratios. Precise camber and sidecut profiles are tuned for specific disciplines. Base preparation—waxing and structuring—can make the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p>Modern athletes like <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> and <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> benefit from decades of equipment evolution, using gear that would be unimaginable to skiing pioneers.</p>", "de": "<p>Die Technologie hinter dem Skifahren hat sich seit den frühesten Tagen des Sports bis zur Unkenntlichkeit verändert. Jedes Stück moderner Skiausrüstung repräsentiert Jahrhunderte der Innovation.</p><h2>Antike Skier</h2><p>Die frühesten Skier, die über 5.000 Jahre zurückreichen, waren einfache Holzbretter.</p><h2>Metallkanten-Revolution</h2><p>1928 führte der österreichische Erfinder Rudolph Lettner Metallkanten an Skiern ein und transformierte damit den Sport.</p><h2>Renntechnologie</h2><p>Moderne Athleten wie <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> und <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> profitieren von Jahrzehnten der Ausrüstungsentwicklung.</p>", "fr": "<p>La technologie derrière le ski s''est transformée au-delà de toute reconnaissance depuis les premiers jours du sport.</p><h2>Skis anciens</h2><p>Les premiers skis, datant de plus de 5 000 ans, étaient de simples planches de bois.</p><h2>Révolution des carres métalliques</h2><p>En 1928, l''inventeur autrichien Rudolph Lettner a introduit les carres métalliques aux skis, transformant le sport.</p><h2>Technologie de course</h2><p>Les athlètes modernes comme <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> et <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> bénéficient de décennies d''évolution de l''équipement.</p>", "it": "<p>La tecnologia dietro lo sci si è trasformata oltre ogni riconoscimento dai primi giorni dello sport.</p><h2>Sci antichi</h2><p>I primi sci, risalenti a oltre 5.000 anni fa, erano semplici assi di legno.</p><h2>Rivoluzione delle lamine metalliche</h2><p>Nel 1928, l''inventore austriaco Rudolph Lettner introdusse le lamine metalliche agli sci, trasformando lo sport.</p><h2>Tecnologia da gara</h2><p>Atleti moderni come <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> e <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> beneficiano di decenni di evoluzione dell''attrezzatura.</p>", "es": "<p>La tecnología detrás del esquí se ha transformado más allá del reconocimiento desde los primeros días del deporte.</p><h2>Esquís antiguos</h2><p>Los primeros esquís, que datan de hace más de 5.000 años, eran simples tablas de madera.</p>", "pt": "<p>A tecnologia por trás do esqui se transformou além do reconhecimento desde os primeiros dias do esporte.</p><h2>Esquis antigos</h2><p>Os primeiros esquis, datando de mais de 5.000 anos, eram simples pranchas de madeira.</p>", "nl": "<p>De technologie achter skiën is onherkenbaar veranderd sinds de vroegste dagen van de sport.</p><h2>Oude ski''s</h2><p>De vroegste ski''s, meer dan 5.000 jaar oud, waren eenvoudige houten planken.</p>", "ar": "<p>تحولت التكنولوجيا وراء التزلج بشكل لا يمكن التعرف عليه منذ الأيام الأولى للرياضة.</p><h2>الزلاجات القديمة</h2><p>كانت أقدم الزلاجات، التي يعود تاريخها إلى أكثر من 5000 عام، ألواحاً خشبية بسيطة.</p>", "ja": "<p>スキーの背後にある技術は、スポーツの最初の日々から認識できないほど変化してきました。</p><h2>古代のスキー</h2><p>5,000年以上前に遡る最古のスキーは、シンプルな木製の板でした。</p>", "zh": "<p>Huaxue beihou de jishu cong yundong zuizao de shiqi yijing jianjin bu ke shibie.</p><h2>Gudai huaxue</h2><p>Zuizao de huaxue, keyi zhuisu dao 5000 duo nian qian, shi jiandan de muban.</p>", "ko": "<p>스키 뒤의 기술은 스포츠의 초기 시절부터 알아볼 수 없을 정도로 변화했습니다.</p><h2>고대 스키</h2><p>5,000년 이상 전으로 거슬러 올라가는 가장 오래된 스키는 단순한 나무 판자였습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'AS',
    '{"en": "Evolution of ski equipment - From ancient wooden planks to modern carbon fiber racing machines, discover how technology transformed skiing.", "de": "Evolution der Skiausrüstung - Von antiken Holzbrettern zu modernen Carbonfaser-Rennmaschinen.", "fr": "Évolution de l''équipement de ski - Des planches de bois anciennes aux machines de course modernes en fibre de carbone.", "it": "Evoluzione dell''attrezzatura da sci - Dalle antiche assi di legno alle moderne macchine da corsa in fibra di carbonio.", "es": "Evolución del equipo de esquí - De tablas de madera antiguas a máquinas de carreras modernas de fibra de carbono.", "pt": "Evolução do equipamento de esqui - De pranchas de madeira antigas a máquinas de corrida modernas de fibra de carbono.", "nl": "Evolutie van ski-uitrusting - Van oude houten planken tot moderne koolstofvezel racemachines.", "ar": "تطور معدات التزلج - من الألواح الخشبية القديمة إلى آلات السباق الحديثة من ألياف الكربون", "ja": "スキー用品の進化 - 古代の木製板から現代のカーボンファイバーレーシングマシンまで", "zh": "Huaxue zhuangbei yanbian - Cong gudai muban dao xiandai tanxianwei bisai jixie", "ko": "스키 장비의 진화 - 고대 나무 판자에서 현대 탄소 섬유 레이싱 머신까지"}'::jsonb,
    'published',
    NOW(),
    'evergreen'
) ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET
